{# bennu.description: A class, with the package its folder implies -#}
{#-
  A New file template: the file is named after what you type, with this template's extension, and
  what follows is its content. To make your own, create a template from this one.

    name        what was typed, without the extension
    package     the package the folder maps to — empty outside a source root
    file_name   the file being created
    directory   the folder it is created in
    date, year  today

  A comment line of its own reading bennu.file: … names the file instead, and is itself a template.
-#}
{% if package %}
package {{ package }};

{% endif %}
public class {{ name }} {
}
